<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-code-traceability> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication, Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling & 2D AER-FGF / ZPA-Shh limb bud paddle — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring maps each solver to its source and Lean theorem (L1-67, Pass 3 block L48-66); the Section 3b header states every equation, boundary condition, readout and the clock compression (L443-470); function docstrings cite Saunders / Summerbell / Tickle / Laufer / Niswander at the point of use (L558-576, L696-699, L721-727); the registry YAML (laws 5-8) pins Lean loci and code loci. Deductions: the Michaelis forms and the specific constants in LIMB2D_DEFAULTS have no equation-level citation (they are a modelling choice, stated as such but untraced) (-5); the 1/3-2/3 PD trisection is attributed to the progress-zone model but is not an equation of Summerbell-Lewis-Wolpert (1973) (-3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L686–L693: PD trisection attributed to the progress-zone model without an equation citation (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L686-L693>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication, Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling & 2D AER-FGF / ZPA-Shh limb bud paddle — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Everything scored in v2 is intact (linear source-sink L148-152, analytic and PDE SDD L155-238 with RMSE 7.6e-6, expansion-repression scaling L268-340, Crick positional-error law L805-838). Pass 3 adds the requested 2D PD x AP coupling: zero-flux masked 5-point stencil (L547-555), Shh<->FGF feedback and AER-driven growth (L624-639) and a rectangle verification that reproduces the 1D cosh steady state to 2.4e-3 with zero cross-column spread (L696-718), backed by `sdd_2d_steady_state_balance`, `sdd_2d_reduces_to_1d_interior`, `shh_fgf_feedback_aer_ablation_quiescence` and `aer_excision_truncation_monotone` in Lean. The 1D attenuated-graft defect of v2 (4-3-2-3, an ad hoc split keyed on c_ant >= 0.8) is replaced by one valley rule (L347-378) that yields Tickle's sequence. Deductions: the 2D production rates, feedback gain and the three half-saturations are tuned so that FGF ~ 1 and L_final ~ 660 um rather than taken from any source (L472-494) (-3); the developmental clock is compressed 5x (T_s = 12 h for HH18 -> HH28, L488-489, L467-470) (-2); AER and ZPA positions are geometric inputs and new rows are born at zero concentration, so there is no proliferation field and the ZPA 'follows the tip' by construction (L501-544) (-2); digit identity is instantaneous concentration, not exposure (L728-731) (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L472–L494: LIMB2D_DEFAULTS: s_F, s_S, g_S, K_S, K_FS, K_g, v_max are tuned constants without a literature source (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L472-L494>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-5> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-morphometric-validation> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication, Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling & 2D AER-FGF / ZPA-Shh limb bud paddle — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1431-1627) now returns 16 reference-anchored measurements: the 8 v2 metrics plus 2D wild-type digit count 3/3, 2D full-graft count 6/6, Tickle (1981) dose matches 4/4, Saunders/Summerbell segment matches 5/5, truncation-stage rho 1.0/1.0, Shh remaining after AER removal 5.7e-4 (ref 0), wild-type AER FGF P/A 1.56 (ref 1.0 null) and the 2D-vs-cosh RMSE 2.4e-3 (ref 0). Deductions: four of the new references are ordinal or null baselines (segment table with a +/- 1-stage caveat, dose levels chosen to span the classes, reference 0 for Shh loss, reference 1.0 for an asymmetry that is only qualitatively > 1), so they test ordering rather than magnitude (-6); no measurement compares the paddle's shape or L(t) with measured bud dimensions (-4)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L1511–L1530: Shh-loss and P/A measurements use reference 0 and 1.0 baselines — ordinal, not quantitative (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L1511-L1530>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-2d-paddle-anterior-zpa-graft-strength-1-0-mirror-duplication-digit-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-2d-paddle-wild-type-distal-digit-count-posterior-zpa-shh-aer-fgf-outgrowth>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-2d-stencil-code-verification-rmse-of-non-growing-rectangle-with-clamped-aer-vs-1d-cosh-steady-state>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-aer-excision-truncation-level-vs-stage-of-excision-spearman-rho>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-aer-excision-truncation-stages-whose-predicted-most-distal-pd-segment-matches-saunders-1948-summerbell-1974>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-aer-fgf-posterior-anterior-ratio-in-wild-type-shh-induced-posterior-fgf4-component>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-expansion-repression-scaled-blue-zone-fraction-across-hh18-hh28-l-180-660-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-gallus-gallus-72h-embryo-specimen-radial-sdd-decay-length-lambda-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-gallus-gallus-72h-embryo-specimen-radial-sdd-goodness-of-fit-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-positional-boundary-precision-monte-carlo-vs-analytical-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-sdd-characteristic-decay-length-lambda-sqrt-d-k>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-shh-remaining-3-h-after-aer-excision-max-over-hh20-hh26-fraction-of-pre-excision-peak>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-tickle-1981-graft-dose-series-graft-strengths-whose-extra-digit-count-matches-0-0-10-0-35-1-0-0-1-2-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-tickle-et-al-1975-anterior-zpa-graft-mirror-duplication-digit-count-4-3-2-2-3-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-tickle-et-al-1975-wild-type-posterior-zpa-chick-wing-digit-count-4-3-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-zpa-ablation-cyclopamine-negative-control-digit-count>,
