    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py L1240–L1261: Panel H renders the dose series; no panel sweeps g_S or the K constants (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py#L1240-L1261>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-parameter-expressivity-1>,
